    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d216">

                <pb facs="0373" n="241" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv01/pg241"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 E. W./7–1345: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 216 <lb/>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extracts]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d216-f1"/></seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-07-13T17:00:00+02:00">July 13, 1945—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>7075. FonOff has replied as follows to our communications<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d216-f2"/>…:</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>In view of the opinions expressed by the State Dept we have not as we had
                        intended put our proposals<anchor n="3" xml:id="d216-f3"/> to the Soviet
                        Govt in advance <pb facs="0374" n="242" xml:id="pg242"/> of the forthcoming
                        conference. We may, however, wish to put them forward at the conference.</p>
                </quote>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d216-f1" n="1" xml:id="d216-f1-content">
                <p>For the full text of this message, see <ref target="#d312">document No.
                    312</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d216-f2" n="2" xml:id="d216-f2-content">
                <p>See documents Nos. 190 and 303.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d216-f3" n="3" xml:id="d216-f3-content">
                <p>Concerning the conclusion of peace treaties with Bulgaria, Hungary, and
                    Rumania.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
